ublished so far  which might be mainly due to the lack of  the distinctive mustache however the  beard can still be hoped for after all  we're talking about an origin story here  and on instagram wahlberg can indeed be  seen with a typical facial hair you can  convince yourself of the final result in  theaters from february 11 2022  just over three weeks after uncharted  the next movie will then be the batman  in march  set in the 1990s the noir narrative will  pay special attention to batman's  detective skills and will be a  standalone story with no connection to  the dceu much like joker was in 2019  the dark knight solo adventure will be  directed by mad reefs while hollywood  star robert pattinson will assume the  lead role  the now 7th movie batman was not well  received from the start  for many the 35 year old is still too  much associated with the teen saga  twilight and this despite the fact that  in recent years he has clearly  emancipated himself from his previous  parts with serious roles such as in  tanit or the lighthouse  along with pattonson we will also see  performances by numerous villains  including paul dano as the riddler zoe  kravitz as an earlier version of  catwoman colin pharrell as the penguin  and john terturo as carmine falcone  as you can see batman will be very busy  in the upcoming film he can of course  also hope for active support from two  mates namely commissioner james gordon  and his benevolent butler alfred  pennyworth  whether the dark knight can't stand up  to his adversaries is something we will  be able to find out as of march 4th 2022  march will continue to be exciting  thanks to doctor strange and the  multiverse of madness  the sequel to the 2016 blockbuster will  as the name suggests take a closer look  at the concept of multiverses after this  was already opened up at the end of the  loki series  the cast is truly gigantic and can  almost compete with the lineup of an  avengers movie it'll feature benedict  cumberbatch as dr steven strange  benedict wong as a loyal companion wong  rachel adams is dr christine palmer chew  talashi for as the main villain carl  mordo elizabeth olsen won the maximum of  aka scarlet witch and last but not least  social gomes who makes her mcu debut as  the young superhero america chavez  further rumors suggest appearances by  tom hiddleston as loki bruce campbell  and probably one of the three spider-man  appearing in norway home meaning either  tom holland toby maguire or andrew  garfield obviously other well-known  stars may also feature in the film as  they might still be kept secret behind  the camera sam raimi is in charge of  directing after the original director  scott derrickson backed out and is now  acting as executive producer doctor  strange and the multiverse of madness  will be released in news theaters on  march 25th 2022  the month of april brings another two  top class films the first is sonic the  hedgehog 2. the sequel revolves around  the new life of the blue hedgehog who  has now found a new home in green hills  among his friends tom and maddie  the threat of dr robotnik's return seems  distant after sonic banished him to a  mushroom planet  just as maddie and tom are on holiday  the villain makes a comeback but he's  not alone  teamed up with knuckles with whom sonic  is not buddies here yet robotnik embarks  on a quest to find a fabled emerald that  holds the power of either destroying or  building entire  civilizations in order to prevent this  incredibly valuable artifact from  falling to the hands of the antagonist  sonny and his friend tails also set out  to find the emerald  as was announced a short time ago idris  elbow will dub the red echidna it goes  without saying that ben swords will once  again be voicing the blue hedgehog while  james marston and tikka sumter will be  back in front of the camera as tom and  maddie together with jim carrey as dr  robotnik  the release of sonic the hedgehog 2 is  scheduled for april 8 2022  marvel's thor franchise has been  thrilling fans around the globe for over  a decade the witty god of thunder will  return to the big screen again next year  for what is now his fourth movie  after the pandemic upset the plans to  start filming in 2020 the time was right  to begin shooting thor love and thunder  in australia at the start of this year  the plot centers on the one hand on thor  himself as he loses the ability to lift  mjolnir  however the focus will be more on  another character namely dr jane foster  mighty thor as she is also called is  worthy of lifting thor's hammer and  henceforth becomes the mighty goddess of  thunder  in principle the two have similar powers  but it is said that there will be some  subtle differences as well  in front of the camera we can look  forward to chris hemsworth as thor  natalie portman as jane foster tessa  thompson as valkyrie and christian bale  as gore the god butcher among many other  familiar faces the release date of thor  love and thunder is set for may 6 2022  the action in john week 4 promises to be  very intense  you don't need to be a clairvoyant to  suspect that this time around we'll be  dealing with a rather angry john wick he  and the bowery king are out for revenge  against the high table the continental  and of course his manager winston  featured on screen will be keanu reeves  as john wick lawrence fishburne is the  bowery king  ian mcshane as winston and lance reddick  as the concierge charon one newcomer is  japanese british pop star arena savayama  who like martial arts legends donnie yen  and scott atkins is expected to take on  an unspecified role likewise joining the  cast in recent weeks and months have  been marco zero hiroyuki zanada chemier  anderson clancy brown and bill skosgod  this is absolutely a cast to be excited  about  john wick chapter 4 will be released on  may 27 2022 in the united states  in june we can look forward to the  conclusion of an extremely successful  film 